                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 711.38/38.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Davis to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-10-06T16:00:00-04:49">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 6, 1915—4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Chamber of Deputies voted ratification this afternoon 75 to 6.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
